<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Phase 3 Best in Slot Gear list for Holy Priest Healer in Wrath of the Lich King Classic. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Trial of the Grand Crusader. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from raids, dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">Best in Slot Gear for Holy Priest Healer Phase 3</h2>
<i>Healer gearing always heavily depends on playstyle, situation and raid environment so treat the BiS list below as a guideline rather than a gospel.</i>
<br/>
<br/>While there is a variety of strong items that can be considered Phase 3 BiS, naturally some of them are rare hardmode drops or highly sought after pieces that will generally go to caster dps first. Due to that, the gear embed below has both a contested and a more realistic setup to choose from, though most players will likely end up with something inbetween.<br/>
<br/>As for gemming, there are several valid ways to gem. You can either fully opt for haste or spell power gems outside of activating your meta gem or alternatively go for gem bonuses to get more stats altogether. If sustain is an issue, slotting some pure intellect gems is also an option, but more considerate spell usage is another way to deal with that. <br/>
<br/>Spell power gems in particular are definitely also a great choice. While your casts will be a bit slower overall, you gain extra healing on cooldown-based abilities like CoH and PoM and they're slightly better for Shadow if you dualspec often.<br/>
<br/>Finally, with hardmode pieces from the previous phase already being very close to <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/icons/heroic.gif");'>Heroic</span> <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4722/trial-of-the-crusader">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Trial of the Crusader</span></a> loot in terms of item level, there are several slots that only have a single heavily contested upgrade, if at all, which makes the gear progression here somewhat underwhelming. <br/>
