<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="emblems">Emblems of Thriumph for Holy Priest Healer Phase 3</h3>These new Emblems will drop from both raid sizes of <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4722/trial-of-the-crusader">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Trial of the Crusader</span></a>, <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=2159/onyxias-lair">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Onyxia's Lair</span></a> and <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4603/vault-of-archavon">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Vault of Archavon</span></a> as well as the new daily Heroic++ dungeons for a possible maximum of 90 per week. <br/>
<br/>The first three items on this list can all realistically be an upgrade for a player who has been raiding Ulduar in the previous phase, but also allow you to get your pretty valueable T9 2p bonus as soon as possible. Choose between them in whatever way best fills in for weakpoints in your current gear.<br/>
<br/>Keep in mind that you will want to save up your <a class="icontiny q1" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a> until you get some Trophies, so that you can go straight for the 245 version of T9 without wasting emblems.<br/>
<br/>Outside of that, these are mostly just used for catch-up gear so feel free to spend them on the Orbs for crafted gear or gold if you feel there's nothing worthwhile left.<br/>
<br/>
