<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="chest">Chest for Holy Priest Healer Phase 3</h3>This slot technically has a very good tier item in the shadow version of the ilvl 258 <span class="q4">Robe of Triumph</span>, but there is quite a significant amount of competition for the required Regalias with them being able to be turned into any of the five tier set pieces and you would likely want to get the Holy pieces for your legs or gloves slots first anyway.<br/>
<br/>Alternatively, the <span class="q4">Merlin's Robe</span> are a possible choice to use until you manage to get <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46993/flowing-vestments-of-ascent">
