<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="rings">Rings for Holy Priest Healer Phase 3</h3>When it comes to new rings there are two notable options, but realistically we should only ever consider one of them. <br/>
<br/>The <span class="q4">Darkmender</span> ring has the typical healer gear stat distribution so only a few people in your raid will be after it, and also gives you a high amount of spellpower and haste. As that one is an easy pick, you can pair it with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45495/conductive-seal">
